  "prefLabel": "Bfc 101.01 Purpose",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfc 101.01 Purpose. The purpose of these rules is to establish the procedures under which the New Hampshire state board of fire control shall operate.\n\nSource. #10553-A, eff 3-25-14",
